2 CONT * Siblings:	Anna Lucia Lundstedt, Elna Catharina Lundstedt, Anna Lucia Lundstedt, Sven Peter Lundstedt, Johannes Lundstedt, Brita Maria Meissner, Elna Catharina Meissner, Sophia Meissner, Christina Meissner
2 CONT * Partner:	Johannes Sandberg
