2 CONT * [https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%93%D0%BE%D0%BB%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%B8%D0%BD,_%D0%9B%D0%B5%D0%BE '''Famous People Throughout History: Leonid Golovin'''] (February 25, 1903 , Saint Petersburg  – May 23, 1969 , Helsinki ) was a Finni
