1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Bert Carpelan worked as a press photographer at the Swedish language newspaper Hufvudstadsbladet (Helsinki) for 35 years.  He was also a critic and columnist at Kameralehti magazine. He received many awards and gra
2 CONC nts throughout his long career as a photographer, while also promoting the joys of amateur photography through the AFK club (Amatörfotograf klubben) which he was a member of throughout his life. He authored two books, the instruct
2 CONC ive and humorous book Knäpp Bättre Bilder (‘Take Better Pictures’) with illustrations by his then wife Lis Carpelan, and Blixtljus (‘Flashlights)’, a memoir of life as a press photographer). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Photos of Bert on Flickr: https://www.flickr.com/photos/200555587@N07/albums/72177720316789121/
