1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Her birthname was Sofia Charlotta Salomon. In 1793 when she was about 16 year old her mother married Georg Henrik Jägerhorn af Spurila. Since then her lastname was marked as Jägerhorn. She moved to Savonlinna, Finl
2 CONC and 1827. She died 1865 in Savonlinna, Finland where her name was marked as Sofia Malm.
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: http://www.mattiasloman.se/forskning/index.php?title=Salomon
