2 CONC ig gifta,men levde hela livet som ett par. (modernt)
2 CONT
2 CONT Fick ett barn men detta dog som spädbarn
2 CONT
2 CONT Housekeeper in Johannes Järn=(Iron) in Vedby / Klippan. Maria and Johannes took a liking to each other and gone be married. But on his way to church to take the bans so overturned horse trailer , so they went back home and was nev
2 CONC er married, but lived life as a couple. (modern)
2 CONT
2 CONT Had a child but it died in infancy
