1 NOTE {geni:about_me} I was born on Feb. 28, 1928 and during my childhood and teenage I lived with my parents in Buenos Aires, in the Flores Sur neighborhood, I studied in the American School and afer finishing high school I started wor
2 CONC king as a Spanish-English secretary for the City Bank in Buenos Aires. Sten and I married in Aug. 04, 1949 and we lived in an apartment at Calle Méjico 610, in Buenos Aires. After the birth of Ernesto Carlos I resigned from my job
2 CONC  and shortly before the birth of Eduado Luis, we moved to Villa Ballester, calle Lavalle 555. In Dec 1953, we travelled by ship from Buenos Aires to Santos, Brasil, and then to São Paulo, where Sten started working, as he was tran
2 CONC sferred to the subsidiary of Sandvik. There I kept on beeing a housewife as formerly in Buenos Aires. We had three more children: Sten Paulo, Margarida Helena and Arnaldo Erik, that kept me rather busy for the rest of my life.  
2 CONT
2 CONT Above information was written in the first person by her loving husband, Sten. 
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1990 Helen got sick, the diagnosis was "Alzheimer Disease" and after six years she left us.  
