2 CONT 20.6.1828 Henrik Vilhelm Hellström 14477. * Born in Turku (Finnish parish) 28.11.1809. Parents: Turku carpenter Henrik Hellström and Ester Jakobsdotter. Student at Turku Cathedral School 31.1.1820 (in cl. prim.) – (1826). Private 
2 CONC certificate s.d. Entrance examination 16.6.1828. Matriculated in Turku 20.6.1828. Member of the Turku Nation 3.10.1829. Henric Wilhelm Hellström. \ 29/11 1809. ‹–› \ ... \ ‹–› \ ‹–› \ Priest. Ordained as priest in the Diocese of T
2 CONC urku 20.12.1831. — Served as a priest in Vihti and Pohja. Fagervik factory chaplain and pedagog 1835. Chaplain of Karis 1844, Espoo 1854. Vice pastor 1850. Vicar of Vihti 1857. Rural dean 1865. Preacher at the clerical conference 
2 CONC in Turku 1864. † Died in Vihti 8.10.1869. Spouse: 1835 Vilhelmina Sofia Printz († 1892).
2 CONT
