1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''William Hay''' became a burgess of Stockholm on 5 May 1638. He was a merchant who traded with Danzig. He is probably the father of ''William'' and ''Henry'' according to 'Stockholms Nations Studenter'. His wife 
2 CONC was named '''Ingrid''' and is noted as a widow in 1659 when Walter Guthrie raises a case against her with regard to her dead husband.
