1 NAME Jakob Isacsson /Bremer/
2 GIVN Jakob Isacsson
2 SURN Bremer
2 _MARNM Bremer
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 19 JUN 1711
2 ADDR
3 CITY Västerås
3 CTRY Sweden
