1 CONT SOURCE CITATION:
1 CONT Title: Genealogiska Institutel
1 CONT Author: Sven Kinderstam
1 CONT Source Comments: Genealogiska Institutel is a source created by Sven Kinderstam,
1 CONT Sondragro, Sweden that contains information from parishes in Sweden.
1 CONT The following pertain to this family:
1 CONT Parish Register of Skurup: 1,3,6,76,14,15
1 CONT Parish Register of Simrishamn: #27, and 4
1 CONT Parish Register or Östra Vemmenhög: #2
1 CONT Parish Register pf Vittskovle: #5,10,11,20,21
1 CONT This was the source from an FGR from Rececca Gustaveson Harris.
1 CONT
1 CONT 1- This record was prepared and submitted to the Idaho Falls Temple
1 CONT by        Rebbeca Gustavson Harris, daughter of Hannah Anderson
1 CONT Gustavson. Birth place also shown as Östra, Vemonenhog, Malmohus,
1 CONT Sweden. (The correct birth place should be Östra Vemmenhög,
1 CONT Malmohus, Sweden. The term Östra (Eastern) was dropped after 1952.)
1 CONT
